      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 122.0,
        "t": 732.29,
        "r": 528.1200000000003,
        "b": 708.7
      },
      "content": "Insert the HDD cradle mounting tab in the slot in the sheet-metal (callout 1), and then rotate the connector end (callout 2) of the HDD toward the formatter."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_5396",
      "reading_order": 7473,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 122.0,
        "t": 458.42,
        "r": 550.1600600000002,
        "b": 434.83
      },
      "content": "Make sure that the locking connector (callout 1) latches and that the standoff (callout 2) engages with the slot in the formatter (it might be necessary to pinch the retainer to engage it with the slot)."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_5397",
      "reading_order": 7474,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 100.0,
        "t": 175.87672999999995,
        "r": 227.3699999999999,
        "b": 164.28673000000003
      },
      "content": "Install the formatter cover ."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_5398",
      "reading_order": 7475,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 122.00001,
        "t": 156.45673,
        "r": 239.11000999999996,
        "b": 142.36672999999996
      },
      "content": "▲ Do one of the following:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_5399",
      "reading_order": 7476,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 122.0,
        "t": 133.26625,
        "r": 548.3300000000006,
        "b": 109.6762500000001
      },
      "content": "M501: Slide it toward the front of the printer to install it (callout 1), and then install one screw (callout 2)."
    },
